@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-mappings.owl>
  a owl:Ontology ;
  owl:imports <https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations.owl> ;
  dc:title "ValueNet Mappings"@en ;
  dc:description "Provides SKOS mappings from the BFO-aligned ValueNet back to the original ValueNet and related value ontologies."@en .

<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#CareDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Care> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#FairnessDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Fairness>, <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/values/CurryMoralMolecules.owl#Fairness> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#LoyaltyDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Loyalty> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#AuthorityDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Authority> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#SanctityDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Sanctity> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#LibertyDisposition> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Liberty> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-core#ValueRelatedRealizableEntity> skos:broadMatch <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/values/valuecore_with_value_frames.owl#Value> .
### Violations. The original mft.ttl models these as subclasses of
### mft:Violation, a kind of Value; the BFO refactor models them as processes,
### so the mapping is broadMatch rather than exactMatch.
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#HarmProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Harm> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#CheatingProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Cheating> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#BetrayalProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Betrayal> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#SubversionProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Subversion> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#DegradationProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Degradation> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-moral-foundations#OppressionProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Oppression> .
<https://fandaws.com/ontology/bfo/valuenet-core#ValueViolationProcess> skos:broadMatch <https://w3id.org/spice/SON/HaidtValues#Violation> .
